{"id":"n68810-1-9","stage":3,"title":"운동선수 · 运动选手","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68810-1-9-1","ko":"승규는 운동을 잘하니까 커서 운동선수가 되면 좋겠구나.","zh":"承奎运动那么好，等长大了当运动员该多好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"3","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하니까","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커서","meaning":"成长","explanation":"크다：成长；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"2","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동선수가","meaning":"运动选手，运动员","explanation":"운동선수：运动选手，运动员；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"운동선수","audio":"/audio/7ffd90a7ddb2cf7aef82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68810","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되면","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠구나.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"根据定好的规则和方法活动身体，较量能力或技术。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"成长","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"长大成人。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"7ffd90a7ddb2cf7a","term":"운동선수","zh":"运动选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/7ffd90a7ddb2cf7aef82.mp3","entryId":"68810","definition":"在运动方面有天赋，专门从事运动的人。","pronunciation":["운ː동선수"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0a42e9a29aaa0c07d24e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68810-1-9-2","ko":"네, 저는 축구 선수가 될 거예요.","zh":"是的，我打算成为一名足球运动员。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선수가","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요.","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/989a28fdb78496cd8d67.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.748,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68810","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5747,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，我打算成为一名足球运动员。","承奎运动那么好，等长大了当运动员该多好啊。","最近头痛越来越严重，让我很苦恼。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎运动那么好，等长大了当运动员该多好啊。","最近头痛越来越严重，让我很苦恼。","是的，我打算成为一名足球运动员。"],"answer":2}]}
